      "text": "whoso lays hands upon Nephi1 shall be as naught before power of God, 1 Ne. 17:48. because of iniquity, world will judge the Lord thing of naught, 1 Ne. 19:7–9. without opposition, all things must have been created for naught, 2 Ne. 2:11–12. terrible one to be brought to naught, 2 Ne. 27:31. they who turn aside just for thing of naught shall be cut off, 2 Ne. 27:32 (28:16). because they harden hearts, many cast away writings as things of naught, 2 Ne. 33:2. Nephites see they had set at naught God’s commandments, Hel. 4:21. men set at naught God’s counsels, Hel. 12:6. ye have sold yourselves for naught, 3 Ne. 20:38. this people to be counted as naught among Gentiles, Morm. 5:9. Jaredites esteem Ether as naught, Ether 13:13. he who says little children need baptism sets at naught Atonement, Moro. 8:20.",
